  "summary": "The authors’ R script exported normothermia minus torpor under a torpor-minus-normothermia filename. After correcting that sign once, all 15,099 registered genes paired with the full author workbook. Direction agreed for 12,932 genes (85.65%), with Pearson 0.8051 and Spearman 0.8299, below both author-concordance-v2 acceptance routes. The proposal records the comparison and preserves both orientations. [Author deposit](https://doi.org/10.18725/OPARU-45070)",
